WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Hey, I'm AVA, UNIT's renewal worker.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.760
People remember birthdays. They forget renewals, licenses expire, subscriptions end, deadlines sneak up.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:15.520
I remember. I prepare everything. I make sure nothing important slips through.

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:21.360
I sleep better when your renewals are done. See you tomorrow!
